        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bold and Bombastic Beethoven      Lethbridge Symphony Orchestra     with guest John Paul Ksiazek, piano    Beethoven used a novel approach while creating the heroic Emperor Concerto; it was a time of great change for him during a war-ridden era and time to let go of old habits.&nbsp; This concer"
