        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Dad and Daughters - a Much-Loved Story      Lethbridge Symphony Orchestra     with guests from The Little Lethbridge Opera Theatre    Tevye, the milkman, must contend with the desires of his three strong-willed daughters.&nbsp; They each want to marry - for love!&nbsp; Outrageous.&nbsp;"
      }
