    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Inspired by le rive gaûche, the evening will feature live French music, exquisite French cuisine, as well as a live &amp; silent auction. New this year, a local artist will capture the evening in a beautiful painting. This one-of-a-kind work will be auctioned off at the end of the night."
