        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Sponsored by Subway Auto     Traditional tunes and uncommon forms from around the world.      Megan Wittig, soprano &amp; Musaeus String Quartet    Last Leaf, by the Danish String Quartet, is based on traditional Nordic tunes, from more refined waltzes and minuets to the wilder fare of polkas an"
